Package: chanwer
Title: ChanWe Visual Themes for Quarto Workflows
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Chanwe",
           family = "Team",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "team@chanwe.example")
Description: Brand-consistent themes, color palettes, and utilities for
    ChanWe reporting workflows, in the CHANWE v2 language with every value
    read from the brand's generated tokens. Provides a ggplot2 theme with
    custom title, subtitle, KPI-scoreboard, and caption elements, rounded
    bars, pill legend keys, a focus colour rule, discrete and continuous
    color scales, a native Typst table generator for Quarto
    PDF reports, matching gt, reactable and highcharter helpers for HTML
    output, the CHANWE brand fonts (Satoshi, Schibsted Grotesk, JetBrains
    Mono) bundled and registered for ggplot2 and served locally to HTML
    output, and Quarto-ready styling tokens for HTML and Typst outputs.
